<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“Make it hot! Make it hot!</l><l>Make it seven times hot!</l><l>You had better serve our gods!”</l><l>But our God whom we serve</l><l>can deliver us.</l><l>We will not, not, not!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We will not! We will not!</l><l>We will not, not, not!</l><l>We will not serve your gods!</l><l>Even if God does not</l><l>get us out and it’s hot,</l><l>We will not, not, not!!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
